{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40015","headline":"宫鸎 · 徐夤","name":"宫鸎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"领得春光在帝家，早从深谷出烟霞。\n闲栖仙禁日边柳，饥啄御园天上花。\n睍睆只宜陪阁凤，间关多是问宫娃。\n可怜鹦鹉矜言语，长闭雕笼岁月赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}